When OpenTelemetry is enabled, Portal | php can now also send metrics: the duration of incoming requests (@http.server.request.duration@), of the requests to Gentics Mesh and of the rendering of views, and the lookups of the Gentics Mesh cache, the ETag cache and the HTTP cache. Metrics are sent with @OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER=otlp@ and @OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_METRICS_TEMPORALITY_PREFERENCE=delta@, in Kubernetes with the Helm chart value @otel.metricsEnabled@. They need the PHP extension @opentelemetry@ and are disabled together with the spans by @OTEL_PHP_DISABLED_INSTRUMENTATIONS=portal-php@.